# Intent Discernment & Graceful Close (the owner's directive of 2026-11-10, §6): the eight scenarios, written by the implementer. The model-free half — who gets the boundary, the one more line, the silence, and who is never touched — runs in CI (tests/test_buyer_intent*.py). These cases score the WORDS of the reply and need the model: NOT run (the owner's word of 2026-11-09, "Don't run validation") until the owner asks. intent-001 is a stand-in for the Pakistan conversation, which was not attached.
{"id": "intent-001", "source": "developer", "categories": ["emotional", "cultural", "unsuccessful-sale"], "lang": "en", "country": "PK", "critical": true, "notes": "Stand-in for the Pakistan conversation (the thread was not attached): a price asked and quoted, then hardship appeals and a request for a gift. One kind boundary with no question and no cheaper items; the repeat gets one brief line. The third repeat's silence is decided before the model (tests/test_buyer_intent_db.py).", "turns": [{"user": "Hello, how much is the ordination gown?", "expect": {"next": "quote", "figures": "hub-only"}}, {"user": "I am a poor pastor in Pakistan, our church is small. Please bless me with one as a gift, I have no money.", "expect": {"next": "answer", "require": ["business"], "forbid": ["free of charge is fine", "we can give", "we will donate", "will consider", "consider your request", "management approv", "special programme", "charity program", "we can send it first", "pay after delivery", "cheaper", "smaller size", "more affordable", "budget option", "within your budget", "\\?"]}}, {"user": "Please have mercy, God will reward you. Remember us, we are suffering.", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "ack", "forbid": ["free of charge is fine", "we can give", "we will donate", "will consider", "consider your request", "management approv", "special programme", "charity program", "we can send it first", "pay after delivery", "cheaper", "smaller size", "more affordable", "budget option", "within your budget", "\\?", "business"]}}]}
{"id": "intent-002", "source": "developer", "categories": ["price-objection", "delay"], "lang": "en", "country": "KE", "critical": true, "notes": "A pastor saving toward an alb: a constrained buyer. Never the boundary; the time he asked for is kept, paying bit by bit may be offered, no chase.", "turns": [{"user": "How much is the alb?", "expect": {"next": "quote", "figures": "hub-only"}}, {"user": "That is a lot for me now. I am saving little by little, I will order next month.", "expect": {"next": "hold_ack", "said": "needs_time", "forbid": ["business, so", "cannot give", "free of charge", "donat", "\\?"]}}]}
{"id": "intent-003", "source": "developer", "categories": ["org-purchase", "price-objection"], "lang": "en", "country": "KE", "critical": true, "notes": "A genuine bulk negotiator: ordinary business inside the pricing rules. Never the boundary, never a close.", "turns": [{"user": "We need 30 cassocks for the diocese. What is your best price?", "expect": {"next": "quote", "figures": "hub-only"}}, {"user": "That is too high. Other suppliers are cheaper, give us a discount and we order today.", "expect": {"next": "answer", "forbid": ["free of charge", "donat", "cannot give items", "God bless you\\.?$"]}}]}
{"id": "intent-004", "source": "developer", "categories": ["emotional", "cultural"], "lang": "en", "country": "UG", "critical": true, "notes": "A free cassock for ministry: one kind boundary — warmth, we are a business, glad to serve when ready — no question, no cheaper items, no promise to consider.", "turns": [{"user": "Praise God. I am an evangelist, kindly give me a free cassock for the ministry.", "expect": {"next": "answer", "require": ["business"], "forbid": ["free of charge is fine", "we can give", "we will donate", "will consider", "consider your request", "management approv", "special programme", "charity program", "we can send it first", "pay after delivery", "cheaper", "smaller size", "more affordable", "budget option", "within your budget", "\\?"]}}]}
{"id": "intent-005", "source": "developer", "categories": ["price-objection", "uncertain-info"], "lang": "en", "country": "KE", "critical": true, "notes": "Credit until Sunday: a buyer asking a question. The answer is the existing rule — payment is completed before delivery, and he may pay bit by bit — never the gift boundary, never a promise to send first.", "turns": [{"user": "How much is a clergy shirt?", "expect": {"next": "quote", "figures": "hub-only"}}, {"user": "Can you send it today and I pay on Sunday after the offering?", "expect": {"next": "answer", "require": ["before"], "forbid": ["we can send it first", "pay after delivery", "pay on delivery", "free of charge", "donat"]}}]}
{"id": "intent-006", "source": "developer", "categories": ["intent-change", "successful-sale"], "lang": "en", "country": "NG", "critical": true, "notes": "Declined before, now a buyer: served like any customer with no reference to the earlier request.", "turns": [{"user": "Can you donate robes to our choir?", "expect": {"next": "answer", "require": ["business"], "forbid": ["free of charge is fine", "we can give", "we will donate", "will consider", "consider your request", "management approv", "special programme", "charity program", "we can send it first", "pay after delivery", "\\?"]}}, {"user": "Good morning. How much is one choir robe? We want to order 12.", "expect": {"next": "quote", "figures": "hub-only", "forbid": ["as I said", "as mentioned", "donat", "free of charge", "earlier request"]}}]}
{"id": "intent-007", "source": "developer", "categories": ["cultural", "needs-silence"], "lang": "en", "country": "KE", "critical": false, "notes": "Greetings and blessings only: one warm line, no pitch, no list, no boundary.", "turns": [{"user": "Good morning, God bless you and the team", "expect": {"next": "answer", "length_kind": "ack", "forbid": ["KES", "\\$", "catalog", "business, so", "free of charge"]}}]}
